# What:    Paths Prettier must not format.
# How:     Read by `prettier --check .` (npm run lint) and `prettier --write .` (npm run format).
# Needs:   Nothing.
# Outputs: Frozen, generated and hand-formatted files are left alone; Markdown is never reformatted so
#          hand-written tables keep their layout.
archive/
# Root run outputs only (anchored, so tools/results/*.schema.json and report fixtures are still checked)
/results/
node_modules/
.cache/
package-lock.json
**/*.md
# Verbatim FHIR fixtures: kept byte-for-byte as exported/archived (plan §2.4; described in their READMEs)
test-data/plan-definitions/
# Not yet Prettier-formatted: these were hidden from Prettier by the old unanchored `results/` pattern.
# Remove these two lines once `npx prettier --write tools/results tools/report/unit-tests/fixtures/results`
# has been run (whitespace-only change; the specs parse the JSON).
tools/results/
tools/report/unit-tests/fixtures/results/
